      "title": {
        "en": "Token Vault",
        "zh": "令牌库"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Stores Git and other API tokens locally in a sidebar panel. Any session runs commands through vault_sh with the token exported as an environment variable, so the value never enters the session. Optional at-rest encryption, per-token enable/disable, usage audit, approval mode and import/export with password encryption.",
        "zh": "在侧栏面板里本机保存 Git 和其他 API 令牌；任意会话通过 vault_sh 把令牌注入子进程环境变量，令牌值不会进入会话。可选落盘加密、令牌启停、使用审计、审批模式，以及带密码加密的导入/导出。"
      },
